1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,037
No signal.

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,606
No network.

3
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,586
No way to call for help.

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:11,888
Meet Ranger! A pocket radio that keeps you connected. No towers, no SIM card, no internet!

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:18,243
Rangers talk directly to each other over long range LoRa radio. Up to eight kilometers!

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:23,518
And every Ranger relays for the others, so the mesh keeps on growing. Fully encrypted!

7
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:25,126
Send texts!

8
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,146
Push to talk!

9
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:31,178
Track your team!

10
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:34,467
Share your location!

11
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,990
Hit SOS to alert everyone!

12
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,772
Even join from your phone. No app needed!

13
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,136
Rescue teams!

14
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:45,786
Remote patrols!

15
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,114
Lost hikers!

16
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,863
Anyone, anywhere the network can't reach!

17
00:00:53,200 --> 00:01:02,804
Designed from scratch, on a custom PCB. With an ESP32, a LoRa radio, GPS, and a battery that lasts for days on standby.

18
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,390
All for around three thousand rupees!

19
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:10,485
Ranger. Stay connected, anywhere. Scan the code to learn more!

